# Keep LF in the repo and in every working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows editor can rewrite the whole tree to CRLF. That is not
# cosmetic here: Prisma stores a checksum of every applied migration, so changing
# the bytes of an already-applied migration.sql makes `prisma migrate deploy`
# fail against production with "migration was modified after it was applied".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4  binary
*.zip  binary
*.tgz  binary
*.dump binary
